                                <div class=3D"summarytext">
                                    <div class=3D"no-overflow"><p>Today, Te=
 Tiriti o Waitangi, is honoured in the NZ healthcare sector by applying its=
 principles to our health and disability system. The principles provide gui=
delines for addressing and promoting equitable health outcomes as well as u=
pholding M=C4=81ori rights to self-determination.</p>

<p>Before we look at the treaty principles, let=E2=80=99s review what is me=
ant by =E2=80=9Cequitable health outcomes=E2=80=9D and =E2=80=9Cself-determ=
ination.=E2=80=9D Click on the + expand button to reveal&nbsp; an explanati=
on of these terms.</p>

<div class=3D"up-accordion"><button aria-expanded=3D"false" class=3D"up-acc=
ordion__btn" role=3D"button" title=3D"Expand"><span class=3D"up-accordion__=
label">Equitable Health Outcomes </span> <svg aria-hidden=3D"true" class=3D=
"up-accordion__icon up-icon" height=3D"64px" version=3D"1.1" viewBox=3D"0 0=
 64 64" width=3D"64px" xmlns=3D"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink=3D"=
http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"><defs><mask class=3D"up-icon__mask"><rect cla=
ss=3D"up-icon__mask up-icon__mask--visible" height=3D"64" width=3D"64" x=3D=
"0" y=3D"0"></rect><circle class=3D"up-icon__mask up-icon__mask--hidden" cx=
=3D"32" cy=3D"32" r=3D"18"></circle></mask></defs><circle class=3D"up-icon_=
_tint" cx=3D"32" cy=3D"32" r=3D"20"></circle><g class=3D"up-icon__strokes">=
<line class=3D"up-icon__stroke" x1=3D"32" x2=3D"32" y1=3D"24.5" y2=3D"39.5"=
></line><line class=3D"up-icon__stroke" x1=3D"24.5" x2=3D"39.5" y1=3D"32" y=
2=3D"32"></line></g></svg></button>

<div class=3D"up-accordion__inner">
<p>This refers to the goal of achieving a fair distribution of health acros=
s different population groups. In an equitable healthcare system, everyone =
has a fair opportunity to attain their full health potential, and no one is=
 disadvantaged from achieving this potential because of their social positi=
on or other socially determined circumstances. It=E2=80=99s not just about =
equal treatment, but about providing care that accounts for people=E2=80=99=
s different circumstances and needs.</p>
</div>
</div>

<div class=3D"up-accordion"><button aria-expanded=3D"false" class=3D"up-acc=
ordion__btn" role=3D"button" title=3D"Expand"><span class=3D"up-accordion__=
label">Self-Determination </span> <svg aria-hidden=3D"true" class=3D"up-acc=
ordion__icon up-icon" height=3D"64px" version=3D"1.1" viewBox=3D"0 0 64 64"=
 width=3D"64px" xmlns=3D"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink=3D"http://=
