                                    <div class=3D"no-overflow"><p>When look=
ing at te Tiriti principles we have discussed the concept of =E2=80=98equit=
y.=E2=80=99 Let=E2=80=99s review the meaning of equality and equity.</p>

<p>Take a look at the following illustration, what do you think it is showi=
ng us about the difference between the concepts of equality and equity?</p>

<p>Take a moment to write down your own thoughts before moving on to read t=
he definitions.</p>

<p><img alt=3D"Equality vs Equity Diagram" src=3D"https://nzma.uplearn.educ=
ation/pluginfile.php/97054/course/section/19835/node-8554-asset-1.svg"></p>

<p>Click on the expand button to read the definitions</p>

<div class=3D"up-accordion"><button aria-expanded=3D"false" class=3D"up-acc=
