label">Equality </span> <svg aria-hidden=3D"true" class=3D"up-accordion__ic=
on up-icon" height=3D"64px" version=3D"1.1" viewBox=3D"0 0 64 64" width=3D"=
64px" xmlns=3D"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink=3D"http://www.w3.org=
/1999/xlink"><defs><mask class=3D"up-icon__mask"><rect class=3D"up-icon__ma=
