ss=3D"up-icon__stroke" x1=3D"24.5" x2=3D"39.5" y1=3D"32" y2=3D"32"></line><=
/g></svg></button>

<div class=3D"up-accordion__inner">
<p>Equality refers to the state of being equal, especially in status, right=
s, and opportunities. It implies that all individuals or groups are treated=
 the same and have the same access to opportunities, resources, and rights =
without discrimination on any grounds.</p>

<p>In the illustration, after giving each person the same amount of boxes t=
hey all remain at different heights.</p>
</div>
</div>

<div class=3D"up-accordion"><button aria-expanded=3D"false" class=3D"up-acc=
ordion__btn" role=3D"button" title=3D"Expand"><span class=3D"up-accordion__=
